d:A field recording from the atrium — twenty-six minutes of rain on glass, wind, and a drone that never quite resolves. The ensemble swears nothing was added in post. The archivist disagrees: she says the room is answering itself, and that if you look at the recording instead of listening to it, you can see where. Every reflection in here points at another one. Only one of them points out.



